[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=10 format=3]

; Open World Golf — Base Theme
; Drop into your Godot 4.6 project at res://ui/theme.tres
; Assign as the default theme on each Control scene root.
;
; This theme defines:
;   • Panel — dark forest green card surface
;   • Button — cream pill button (primary CTA)
;   • Label — cream text default
;   • LineEdit — name input style with lime focus border
;
; Custom Theme Type "OptionCard" is used by the locker-room-style
; gender/handedness cards (cream bg, lime ring on selected state).

